<title>JAPAN: Fujiya -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujiya -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 49.46		vs	   52.35</p>
<p> Operating   loss 652    million	  vs     loss 2.97</p>
<p> Current     loss 382    million	  vs     loss 2.54</p>
<p> Net	   loss 373    million	  vs    loss 10.86</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.95 yen	  vs    loss 85.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    126 million	  vs	 126 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujiya Co Ltd is a confectioner.</p>
